# Nightmesh fixture generator
mtllib problems.mtl
o Panel
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 1 0
v 0 1 0
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
usemtl Textured
f 1/1 2/2 3/3 4/4
# A face naming a vertex the file lacks.
f 1 2 99
usemtl Undefined
f 1 3 4
# A free-form curve, which is valid OBJ but not drawn.
cstype bspline
deg 2
curv 0 1 1 2 3
end
